WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:08.960
Record a delivery against its order, so the store and the bill are checked against what really came.

2
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:14.420
When the supplier delivers, open the order. Late ones are listed here.

3
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:18.000
Open Late deliveries.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.400
And the order.

5
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.520
Receive goods lists what is still to come, line by line.

6
00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:30.820
Type the number on the supplier's delivery note.

7
00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:36.720
Change a quantity if less came. The rest stays open on the order.

8
00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:43.180
Record the delivery. Stock items go into the store at their real cost.

9
00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:51.820
When the bill comes, it is checked against what was ordered and received. A difference is flagged before anyone pays.
